       ES-EXIT.                EXIT.

       EXPAND-RESTRICTIONS.
           IF END-SW = "Y"
               MOVE "N" TO END-SW
               GO TO ER-EXIT.

           IF SCREEN-NAME NOT = "VRESTDISP"
               MOVE "VRESTDISP" TO SCREEN-NAME.

           MOVE SPACES         TO SCREEN-REST.
           MOVE DD-LEVEL(SUB)  TO B-LEVEL.
           MOVE LINK-EQUIP     TO B-EQUIP.
           MOVE LINK-WONUM     TO B-WO.
           MOVE MO-NAME        TO B-MONTH.
           MOVE SUB            TO B-DAY.
           MOVE LD-YEAR        TO B-YEAR.

           IF DD-REST-PR(SUB) NOT NUMERIC
               MOVE ZEROS      TO PR-CYCLE
           ELSE
               MOVE DD-REST-PR(SUB) TO PR-CYCLE.

           IF DD-REST-1(SUB) = "A"
               MOVE "X"        TO R-A
           ELSE
           IF DD-REST-1(SUB) = "B"
               MOVE "X"        TO R-B
           ELSE
           IF DD-REST-1(SUB) = "C"
               MOVE "X"        TO R-C
           ELSE
           IF DD-REST-1(SUB) = "D"
               MOVE "X"        TO R-D.

           MOVE SCREEN-REST     TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM SHOWFORM-REST THRU SR-EXIT.
           GO TO ER-EXIT.

       SHOWFORM-REST.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC  FORMAT IS SCREEN-NAME
               INDIC ARE SCREEN-INDICATORS.
           IF SCREEN-STATUS NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY "SCREEN WRITE ERROR.  SCREEN-STATUS IS "
                        SCREEN-STATUS
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

           READ  DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS SCREEN-NAME
               INDIC ARE SCREEN-INDICATORS
           IF SCREEN-STATUS NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY "SCREEN READ ERROR.  SCREEN-STATUS IS "
                        SCREEN-STATUS
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

           MOVE ALL B"0"       TO SCREEN-INDICATORS.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC    TO SCREEN-REST.

           IF KEY-HIT = 3 OR 8
               MOVE "Y"        TO END-SW
               GO TO SR-EXIT.

           IF KEY-HIT = 7
               MOVE 451        TO HELP-SW
               CALL "SPMHELPM" USING HELP-SW
               GO TO SHOWFORM-REST.


       SR-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       ER-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       END-OF-JOB.
           CLOSE PM-SCHEDULE
                 DISPLAY-FILE.
           GOBACK.

       999-ERROR.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO ERRMSG.
           MOVE TRUE-VAL TO IND(99).
